 "kind": "definition",
 "title": "Perfect complexes",
 "statement": "Let $X$ be a scheme and $E\\in D(\\mathcal{O}_X)$. $E$ is *perfect* if it is\nlocally (on an affine open cover of $X$) isomorphic to a bounded complex\nof finite projective modules (Derived Categories of Schemes,\nSection 36.31, Tag\n[0BDH](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/0BDH)); the subcategory\nis $D_{\\mathrm{perf}}(\\mathcal{O}_X)$.",
